# Stock Firmware — rabbit_OS_v2.3.1_20260910192308
# Android 13 (SDK 33), ro.build.date.utc=1789068655 (2026-09-10)
#
# Captured from a physical Rabbit R1 via mtkclient (MediaTek preloader/DA).
# There is NO official download for this build: the newest published release on
# rabbit-hmi-oss/firmware is v0.8.293 (May 2025), so this dump is the only record
# of what the device was actually running.
#
# Caveats:
#  - The source device was Magisk-rooted. Slot A carries the patch, which is why
#    boot_a != boot_b and vbmeta_a != vbmeta_b. Slot B is the unmodified reference.
#  - `super.bin` includes live COW overlays (virtual A/B snapshot state), so it is
#    the whole system as it booted, not just the base partitions.
#  - These are per-device for the calibration partitions (nvram, nvdata, ...) and
#    build-specific for everything else. A different device on the same build will
#    match the boot-chain hashes but not nvram/nvdata.
#
# Verify (files must be in the current directory):
#   sha256sum -c checksums-stock-v2.3.1.sha256
